{"4727940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OxVOID", "steam_appid": 4727940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4865710], "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727940/extras/ccbda796e37cb139f9e623e537efdcd6.avif?t=1786369370\" width=1400 height=300 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OxVOID is a game about observation, experimentation, and finding patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a player. You are ████, embedded into the body of an autonomous ball-shaped robot. It rolls through sealed ████, where every [LEVEL.DAT] feels like the engineer despised logic and comfort.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727940/extras/5bd0df6cb7bdf295458193390be954d0.avif?t=1786369370\" width=1200 height=300 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corridors. Stations. Machine compartments. Everything is airtight, dense, and slightly hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727940/extras/8483c852fbeafb1f630957012005d6c6.poster.avif?t=1786369370\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727940/extras/8483c852fbeafb1f630957012005d6c6.webm?t=1786369370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727940/extras/8483c852fbeafb1f630957012005d6c6.mp4?t=1786369370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ball is not obligated to obey you. Physics here is not a formality. It [warning: trajectory instability detected]. Early successes look like accidents. That's normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lasers are the nervous system of each level. They connect mechanisms into chains of cause and effect. Cubes become switches. Pistons become temporary walls. Doors become the reward for the system no longer wanting to ████ you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every completed sector is not a victory — it's a new layer of understanding. The system's behavior shifts. Quietly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes a level looks like a mistake. Sometimes the mistake is the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After ████, the level editor unlocks. New logic chains, laser networks, mechanical traps, strange solutions the world has never seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further you go, the stronger the feeling that the system is watching and remembering everything you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727940/extras/cf639fdf18f921fb2799068b05656ee3.avif?t=1786369370\" width=1200 height=150 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Every problem has a solution.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Every solution leaves a trace.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The system remembers everything.</i></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727940/extras/5737ac24d07c1190b6423bfff69d0fb8.avif?t=1786369370\" width=1200 height=150 /></span>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727940/extras/ccbda796e37cb139f9e623e537efdcd6.avif?t=1786369370\" width=1400 height=300 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OxVOID is a game about observation, experimentation, and finding patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a player. You are ████, embedded into the body of an autonomous ball-shaped robot. It rolls through sealed ████, where every [LEVEL.DAT] feels like the engineer despised logic and comfort.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727940/extras/5bd0df6cb7bdf295458193390be954d0.avif?t=1786369370\" width=1200 height=300 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corridors. Stations. Machine compartments. Everything is airtight, dense, and slightly hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727940/extras/8483c852fbeafb1f630957012005d6c6.poster.avif?t=1786369370\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727940/extras/8483c852fbeafb1f630957012005d6c6.webm?t=1786369370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727940/extras/8483c852fbeafb1f630957012005d6c6.mp4?t=1786369370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ball is not obligated to obey you. Physics here is not a formality. It [warning: trajectory instability detected]. Early successes look like accidents. That's normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lasers are the nervous system of each level. They connect mechanisms into chains of cause and effect. Cubes become switches. Pistons become temporary walls. Doors become the reward for the system no longer wanting to ████ you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every completed sector is not a victory — it's a new layer of understanding. The system's behavior shifts. Quietly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes a level looks like a mistake. Sometimes the mistake is the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After ████, the level editor unlocks. New logic chains, laser networks, mechanical traps, strange solutions the world has never seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further you go, the stronger the feeling that the system is watching and remembering everything you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727940/extras/cf639fdf18f921fb2799068b05656ee3.avif?t=1786369370\" width=1200 height=150 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Every problem has a solution.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Every solution leaves a trace.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The system remembers everything.</i></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727940/extras/5737ac24d07c1190b6423bfff69d0fb8.avif?t=1786369370\" width=1200 height=150 /></span>", "short_description": "OxVOID — a minimalist puzzle game where physics, logic, and environment work as a single system. Master the rules through carefully crafted challenges. Then push the boundaries — create your own levels in the built-in editor.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Japanese, Italian, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4727940/7b56a5a1c9cd